## Phase 2 — AI Planning (LLM Integration)

> **Goal:** The AI sidebar sends real prompts to GPT-4o-mini, which returns structured calendar action proposals.

#### [MODIFY] [llm.py](file:///c:/Users/kuday/reschedai/apps/api/app/services/llm.py)
- Replace mock with real OpenAI Chat Completions API call
- System prompt with tool definitions for calendar CRUD
- Parse tool-call responses into [SuggestedAction](file:///c:/Users/kuday/reschedai/apps/api/app/schemas/ai.py#6-9) list
- Support conversation history (stored in Redis with TTL)

#### [MODIFY] [ai.py (route)](file:///c:/Users/kuday/reschedai/apps/api/app/api/routes/ai.py)
- Add `POST /ai/chat` — streaming endpoint (SSE) for conversational AI
- Keep `POST /ai/plan` for one-shot planning requests
- Both require authenticated user

#### [NEW] `apps/api/app/schemas/chat.py`
- `ChatMessage`, `ChatRequest`, `ChatStreamChunk` schemas

#### Frontend changes
#### [MODIFY] [ai-sidebar.tsx](file:///c:/Users/kuday/reschedai/apps/web/src/components/ai-sidebar.tsx)
- Wire to real `/ai/chat` SSE endpoint
- Render streaming responses
- Add action buttons for approving/rejecting calendar suggestions

#### [NEW] `apps/web/src/lib/api.ts`
- Typed API client with auth headers, base URL, error handling

